<title>UK: ASDA Group sets 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>ASDA Group sets 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and NatWest Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASDA GROUP PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    24.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
